kers to monitor their physical condition.","nextNodeIds":[716680403]},{"nodeId":716680403,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30673,"speakerName":"Zhenchen","textMapHash":3236498762,"text":"Tracking them down is no easy task. You'll need the special Inscribed Tracker that Ms. Lamiya has developed.","nextNodeIds":[716680404]},{"nodeId":716680404,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30673,"speakerName":"Zhenchen","textMapHash":2249459378,"text":"I'm not as knowledgeable as she is in this area, so I'll leave the explaining to her.","nextNodeIds":[716680405]},{"nodeId":716680405,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30672,"speakerName":"Lamiya","textMapHash":1203812258,"text":"Agreed. Allow me to explain.","nextNodeIds":[716680406]},{"nodeId":716680406,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30672,"speakerName":"Lamiya","textMapHash":1123348138,"text":"The underlying tech behind the Inscribed Mirror is related to the Akasha, and the operational specifics are quite complex, but don't worry, it's tested and safe.","nextNodeIds":[716680407]},{"nodeId":716680407,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30672,"speakerName":"Lamiya","textMapHash":669471858,"text":"We've already attached micro-transmitters to all the animals, so we just need to read the device's signal, and the mirror will reveal all that can be seen from the animal's perspective.","nextNodeIds":[716680408]},{"nodeId":716680408,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30672,"speakerName":"Lamiya","textMapHash":3274985354,"text":"This device may need some improvements, but this footage will suffice for us to locate active animals.","nextNodeIds":[716680409]},{"nodeId":716680409,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30673,"speakerName":"Zhenchen","textMapHash":3280682842,"text":"That's all there is to it. If you're ready, then we're happy to welcome you to the Claw Convoy!","nextNodeIds":[716680410]},{"nodeId":716680410,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30673,"speakerName":"Zhenchen","textMapHash":3637013122,"text":"Use the Inscribed Mirror to find our animal friends. Both our adopters' gifts and the animals themselves will be waiting for you!","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7166804,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":["30673"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7166801,7166802,7166803,7166804,7166806],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30673,"speakerName":"Zhenchen","count":25},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30672,"speakerName":"Lamiya","count":6},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","count":4}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","BEGCMMJKCFC":[171668],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":3712912526,"CHECNJEMEFE":{"30672":[1170,1190],"30673":[1190]},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_GUIDE","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":true,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[],"GMENNHMBBOH":[],"HCJHEADFCAO":0,"IBEGAHMEABP":[{"<DLGBBMLABOA>k__BackingField":0,"ABDCADBLCFC":0,"AIMIPKGBAHC":"QuestDialogue/WQ/AnimalView_71668/Q7166801","ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","AOLKCANJCMJ":5,"BKDENCDKDEE":"","BPIIFMJLJAJ":[],"DAMGEPEMGNO":false,"DBACCKDPONG":[],"DIAFFIANKPH":false,"DKOMBMCJMMN":false,"EFBOKHEHKJM":[],"EIDINNIHMHD":false,"EKANPNMEFMG":[],"ENDBMMDPPAH":[],"FALLCBHGKON":"LOGIC_NONE","GEPGLHFDBNF":[],"GLJMLHNKKKO":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","HJFLPAICAEO":false,"HNFEAICLPLM":[],"HPPIPDNHFJG":false,"IBGGII